WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Chair, cross the right ankle over the left thigh (figure four).

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Fold forward and plant the hands; rest the right shin on the upper arms.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Bend the elbows like Chaturanga and shift weight into the hands.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lift the left foot, straighten the back leg behind you, and float.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold briefly, then lower and switch sides.
